## RTDB Root Paths

The Firebase Realtime Database uses a single root path structure for this project:

### Primary Root: `pet_feeder/{stationId}`

```
pet_feeder/
├── station_01/                    # Primary station container
│   ├── stationId                  # (string) Unique station identifier
│   ├── stationName                # (string) Human-readable name (default: "Aegis Feeder Alpha")
│   ├── status                     # (string) Current state: "online" | "dispensing_food" | "dispensing_water" | "offline"
│   ├── isSimulated                # (boolean) IoT simulator active flag
│   ├── lastUpdated                # (ISO 8601 timestamp) Last state mutation timestamp
│   ├── updatedAt                  # (ISO 8601 timestamp) Last DB write timestamp
│   │
│   ├── 🐾 LIVE TELEMETRY
│   ├── foodTank                   # (number, grams) Current food in main reservoir [0-2500g]
│   ├── waterTank                  # (number, ml) Current water in main reservoir [0-3000ml]
│   ├── bowlFood                   # (number, grams) Current food in pet bowl [0-150g soft limit]
│   ├── bowlWater                  # (number, ml) Current water in pet bowl [0-250ml soft limit]
│   ├── foodTankTemp               # (number, °C) Food tank temperature [16.0-28.0°C nominal]
│   ├── foodTankMoisture           # (number, %RH) Food tank relative humidity [0-100%, max safe 65%]
│   │
│   ├── 🤖 AUTOMATION FLAGS
│   ├── autoFillWater              # (boolean) Auto-refill water when bowl depletes
│   ├── autoFillFood               # (boolean) Auto-refill food when bowl depletes
│   │
│   ├── ⏱️ OPERATION TIMESTAMPS
│   ├── lastFoodRefill             # (ISO 8601 timestamp | null) Last time food was dispensed
│   ├── lastWaterRefill            # (ISO 8601 timestamp | null) Last time water was dispensed
│   │
│   ├── ⚙️ THRESHOLD CONFIGURATION (Nested Object)
│   └── config
│       ├── tempMin                # (number, °C) Minimum safe temperature [default: 16.0]
│       ├── tempMax                # (number, °C) Maximum safe temperature [default: 28.0]
│       ├── moistureMax            # (number, %RH) Maximum safe humidity [default: 65.0]
│       ├── bowlWaterMin           # (number, ml) Min water before auto-fill triggers [default: 50]
│       ├── bowlWaterMax           # (number, ml) Max water capacity in bowl [default: 200]
│       ├── bowlFoodMin            # (number, g) Min food before auto-fill triggers [default: 30]
│       └── bowlFoodMax            # (number, g) Max food capacity in bowl [default: 100]
│
└── capacities (Nested Object)
    ├── foodTank                   # (number, grams) Main tank capacity [default: 2500g]
    ├── waterTank                  # (number, ml) Main tank capacity [default: 3000ml]
    ├── bowlFoodMaxLimit           # (number, grams) Hard limit for bowl [default: 150g]
    └── bowlWaterMaxLimit          # (number, ml) Hard limit for bowl [default: 250ml]
```

