## Write Operations & Mutations

### Paths Written During Operations

| Operation | Paths Modified | Conditions |
|-----------|---|---|
| **Manual Food Refill** | `foodTank`, `bowlFood`, `status`, `lastFoodRefill`, `lastUpdated` | Tank ≥ amount requested; bowl not full |
| **Manual Water Refill** | `waterTank`, `bowlWater`, `status`, `lastWaterRefill`, `lastUpdated` | Tank ≥ amount requested; bowl not full |
| **Auto-Fill (Food)** | `foodTank`, `bowlFood`, `lastFoodRefill`, `lastUpdated` | autoFillFood=true AND bowlFood ≤ config.bowlFoodMin AND foodTank > 10g |
| **Auto-Fill (Water)** | `waterTank`, `bowlWater`, `lastWaterRefill`, `lastUpdated` | autoFillWater=true AND bowlWater ≤ config.bowlWaterMin AND waterTank > 20ml |
| **Toggle Auto-Fill** | `autoFillFood` or `autoFillWater`, `lastUpdated` | Direct user toggle |
| **Config Update** | `config/*` (all 7 thresholds), `lastUpdated` | Form submission via UI |
| **Bulk Restock** | `foodTank` or `waterTank` (set to capacity), `lastUpdated` | Restock button clicked |
| **IoT Simulation Tick** | `bowlFood`, `bowlWater`, `foodTankTemp`, `foodTankMoisture`, `lastUpdated` | Every 6 seconds if simulator enabled |
| **Radical Spike Test** | `foodTankTemp` or `foodTankMoisture`, `lastUpdated` | Test button (heat/moisture/normalize) |

