## RTDB Read Patterns

### Listener Setup (feeder-service.js:37-88)

```javascript
const dbRef = ref(rtdb, 'pet_feeder/station_01');
this.unsubscribeRTDB = onValue(
  dbRef,
  async (snapshot) => {
    // Full state hydration on every change
    const data = snapshot.val();
    this.state = { ...DEFAULT_STATE, ...data, ... };
  }
);
```

**Behavior:**
- Single listener on entire `pet_feeder/station_01` path
- Full state snapshot on every write
- Merges incoming data with defaults
- Errors trigger local fallback mode

### Initialization Pattern

If path does not exist:
```javascript
await set(dbRef, { ...DEFAULT_STATE, updatedAt: new Date().toISOString() });
```
Seed data written with all default values from `state.js`.

