## Alert Evaluation & Rules Engine

Alerts are **computed client-side** from state using `evaluateAlerts(state)` in `state.js`. No alerts are stored in RTDB.

### Alert Types & Thresholds

| Alert ID | Type | Trigger Condition |
|----------|------|---|
| `radical-temp-high` | critical | `foodTankTemp > config.tempMax` (default: >28°C) |
| `radical-temp-low` | warning | `foodTankTemp < config.tempMin` (default: <16°C) |
| `radical-moisture` | critical | `foodTankMoisture > config.moistureMax` (default: >65%RH) |
| `manual-refill-water` | action_required | autoFillWater=false AND bowlWater ≤ config.bowlWaterMin |
| `manual-refill-food` | action_required | autoFillFood=false AND bowlFood ≤ config.bowlFoodMin |
| `tank-food-low` | warning | `foodTank < 350g` |
| `tank-water-low` | warning | `waterTank < 450ml` |

