## Scalability Considerations

### Current Single-Station Design

```
pet_feeder/
└── station_01/  ← Only one station, hardcoded in code
```

**Code Reference**: `feederService.connectStation(stationId = "station_01")` in feeder-service.js

To support multiple stations, restructure as:
```
pet_feeder/
├── station_01/
├── station_02/
├── station_03/
...
```

Then update:
1. `connectStation()` to accept dynamic `stationId`
2. UI selector to choose active station
3. Listener to re-subscribe on station change

