## Performance Profile

| Metric | Value | Notes |
|--------|-------|-------|
| Listener Payload | Full state snapshot | ~2–4 KB typical state |
| Update Batch Size | 5–8 fields | Uses Firebase `update()` for atomicity |
| Write Latency | ~100–500ms | Depends on network + Firebase backend |
| Polling Interval (Sim) | 6 seconds | `runSimulationTick()` every 6000ms |
| Log Buffer | Max 30 entries | In-memory only; not persisted |

