## Security Rules Requirement

Currently, the app logs warnings about RTDB security rules:

```
RTDB restricted. Set RTDB rules to {".read": true, ".write": true}
```

**Recommended Production Rules:**
```json
{
  "rules": {
    "pet_feeder": {
      "$stationId": {
        ".read": "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

