## Schema Validation

No server-side validation. Client enforces:
- Tank ranges: [0, capacity]
- Bowl ranges: [0, maxLimit]
- Temperature: numeric (°C)
- Humidity: numeric (%RH)
- Timestamps: ISO 8601 strings

Malformed writes bypass validation if written directly to RTDB console.

