## Proposed Restructuring Options

### Option A: Multi-Station Hub (Scale Horizontal)
```
pet_feeder/
├── stations/
│   ├── station_01/
│   ├── station_02/
│   └── ...
└── metadata/
    ├── lastSyncTime
    ├── version
    └── ...
```

### Option B: Station → Nested Subsystems (Scale Vertical)
```
pet_feeder/station_01/
├── telemetry/
│   ├── tanks/
│   ├── bowls/
│   └── climate/
├── operations/
│   ├── history/
│   ├── commands/
│   └── logs/
└── config/
    ├── thresholds/
    └── capacities/
```

### Option C: Event-Sourced (Immutable Log)
```
pet_feeder/station_01/
├── state/          ← Current state snapshot
└── events/
    ├── event_001/
    ├── event_002/
    └── ...
```

**Recommendation**: Use **Option A** for multi-station support without breaking existing single-station logic.
